<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback"><span class="line"><span class="cl">sum = preSum[x2+1][y2+1]      // 整块从原点到右下
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    - preSum[x1][y2+1]        // 砍掉上面
